  "safetyNote": "The law changes when you turn 18. That does not mean it leaves you alone until then. Do what an officer tells you to do, the same as an adult would, and sort the rest out later. Being under 18 does not get you out of anything. What it changes is the process: who has to be called, which court hears it, and what happens after.",
